WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.891
Important tasking gets buried in email.

00:00:02.891 --> 00:00:06.102
PacketRat reads the mail,
finds what needs you,

00:00:06.102 --> 00:00:10.748
shows the reason and the source for
every action, and sends nothing.

00:00:11.548 --> 00:00:16.377
PacketRat is for anyone whose
important tasking gets buried in email.

00:00:16.377 --> 00:00:21.287
It turns an inbox into a short action
queue, with the reason beside every item.

00:00:21.987 --> 00:00:25.391
Mail comes in three ways:
exported message files,

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:27.892
classic Outlook, or Microsoft Graph.

00:00:27.892 --> 00:00:32.576
This demo reads files. Outlook and
Graph are built, but not verified live.

00:00:33.276 --> 00:00:34.805
Everything runs on this PC.

00:00:34.805 --> 00:00:39.967
A launcher starts a PowerShell service
on loopback, a browser shows the queue,

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:40.000
and your rules, dismissals and
counts live in a local data folder.
